  "sourceTitle": "Hamburger Stew",
  "sourceText": "Hamburger Stew\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 3:59am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound ground beef\n1 medium onion, chopped\ncup celery, chopped\ncup green bell pepper, chopped\nteaspoon garlic minced\n1 tablespoon chili powder\n3 cups water\nteaspoon sugar\n1 can Whole kernel corn\n1 can stewed tomatoes\n1 can Ranch style beans\n6 mediums potatoes, cubed\n6 carrots, sliced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Brown ground beef, drain. Add onions, celery, bell pepper, spices and water. Simmer 15 minutes, add all canned vegetables, carrots, and potatoes; simmer until potatoes and carrots are tender, approximately 1 hour.",
